#: website/public/blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html:953
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/touhou-reconstruction/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}TH08:{ph1} {ph2}13 August continuation{ph3}, {ph4}19 August source "
"ledger{ph5}, {ph6}24 August Linux port{ph7}, {ph8}26 August Web "
"edition{ph9}, and {ph10}30 August 64-bit Linux release{ph11}."
