msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "لەبەرگرتنەوە"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-install-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">npx rea-agents@latest setup</span>
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph6}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:245
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Install REA and connect it to this coding agent using {ph3}."
" Show me the setup plan for approval, then verify the "
"installation.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}REA دابمەزرێنە و بەم بریکاری کۆدکردنەوە بیبەستە بە "
"بەکارهێنانی {ph3}. پلانی دامەزراندن پیشانم بدە بۆ پەسەندکردن، پاشان "
"دامەزراندنەکە پشتڕاست بکەرەوە.{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:255
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Or run this command in your terminal:"
msgstr "یان ئەم فەرمانە لە تێرمیناڵەکەتدا جێبەجێ بکە:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:267
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Review the plan, approve the setup, then restart your agent. Already "
"connected? Continue below."
msgstr ""
"پلانەکە پێداچوونەوە بکە، دامەزراندنەکە پەسەند بکە، پاشان بریکارەکەت دووبارە "
"دەستپێبکەرەوە. پێشتر بەستراوەتەوە؟ لە خوارەوە بەردەوام بە."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:273
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "2. Ask where the CSV is written"
msgstr "٢. بپرسە CSV لە کوێ دەنووسرێت"

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:274
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The example is a six-file Electron app with an {ph0}Export notes{ph1} "
"button. Your agent can inspect its code without installing or launching "
"Electron."
msgstr ""
"نموونەکە ئەپی Electronـێکی شەش فایلە لەگەڵ دوگمەی {ph0}Export notes{ph1}. "
"بریکارەکەت دەتوانێت کۆدەکەی بپشکنێت بەبێ دامەزراندن یان کردنەوەی Electron."

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-analysis-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no" >https://rea.tools/examples/notes-
#. example.zip</span >
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">notes.csv</span>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph7}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:295
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Download {ph3} into a new example folder and unpack it. Use "
"REA to find what happens when I click Export notes. Show where {ph4} is "
"written, which fields it contains, and the relevant files and "
"lines.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}{ph3} دابەزێنە بۆ ناو فۆڵدەرێکی نموونەی نوێ و بیەکەرەوە. REA"
" بەکاربهێنە بۆ دۆزینەوەی ئەوەی کە چی ڕوودەدات کاتێک Export notes دەکەم کلیک."
" پیشان بدە {ph4} لە کوێ دەنووسرێت، چ خانەیەکی تێدایە، و فایل و هێڵە "
"پەیوەندیدارەکان.{ph5}{ph6}{ph7}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:309
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Your agent downloads the files and gives the unpacked folder to REA for "
"inspection."
msgstr ""
"بریکارەکەت فایلەکان دابەزێنێت و فۆڵدەری کراوەتەوەکە دەدات بە REA بۆ پشکنین."

#. {ph0}: <a class="button" href="../examples/notes-example.zip"
#. download="notes-example.zip" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:313
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Download example ZIP{ph1}"
msgstr "{ph0}ZIPـی نموونە دابەزێنە{ph1}"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:321
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"If your agent can’t download files, unzip this archive yourself. Give it the"
" path to the {ph0} folder and the same export question."
msgstr ""
"ئەگەر بریکارەکەت نەتوانێت فایل دابەزێنێت، خۆت ئەم ئەرشیفە بکەرەوە. ڕێڕەوی "
"فۆڵدەری {ph0} و هەمان پرسیاری هەناردەکردنی پێ بدە."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:328
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "3. Follow the answer back to the code"
msgstr "٣. وەڵامەکە بگەڕێنەرەوە بۆ کۆدەکە"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:329
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Look for a short explanation with file and line references:"
msgstr "بەدوای ڕوونکردنەوەیەکی کورتدا بگەڕێ لەگەڵ ئاماژە بە فایل و هێڵ:"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>notes.csv</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>id</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>title</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:331
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The button sends a {ph0} message. The main process formats the notes as CSV "
"and writes {ph1} in the user’s Downloads folder. The columns are {ph2} and "
"{ph3}."
msgstr ""
"دوگمەکە پەیامی {ph0} دەنێرێت. پرۆسەی سەرەکی تێبینییەکان وەک CSV فۆرمات دەکات"
" و {ph1} لە فۆڵدەری Downloadsـی بەکارهێنەر دەنووسێت. ستوونەکان {ph2} و "
"{ph3}ن."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:339
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "From the button to the file writer"
msgstr "لە دوگمەکەوە تا نووسەری فایل"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">renderer.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph4}: </span >
#. {ph5}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph6}: <code>notes.exportCsv()</code>
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:341
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}Page · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Export notes{ph4}{ph5}Calls {ph6}.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}پەڕە · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Export notes{ph4}{ph5}بانگ دەکات {ph6}.{ph7}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">preload.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node">
#. {ph4}: <code>notes:export</code>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph7}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:349
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Bridge · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Sends a named message to the "
"main process.{ph7}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}پرد · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}{ph4}{ph5}{ph6}پەیامێکی ناودار دەنێرێت بۆ پرۆسەی "
"سەرەکی.{ph7}"

#. {ph0}: <span class="flow-label" >
#. {ph1}: <span translate="no">main.js</span>
#. {ph2}: </span >
#. {ph3}: <span class="flow-node" >
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">notes.csv</span>
#. {ph5}: </span >
#. {ph6}: <span class="flow-note" >
#. {ph7}: <code>csv.js</code>
#. {ph8}: </span >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:357
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}Handler · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Write {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}Calls the formatter in "
"{ph7} and writes the file.{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}وەڵامدەر · {ph1}{ph2}{ph3}Write {ph4}{ph5}{ph6}فۆرماتکەرەکە لە {ph7} "
"بانگ دەکات و فایلەکە دەنووسێت.{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:368
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"REA’s static analysis pairs the message with its handler. The destination is"
" read from code."
msgstr ""
"شیکارییە ستاتیکییەکەی REA پەیامەکە لەگەڵ وەڵامدەرەکەی دەبەستێتەوە. شوێنی "
"مەبەست لە کۆدەوە دەخوێنرێتەوە."

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">main.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:375
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} · lines 8–12"
msgstr "{ph0} · هێڵەکانی ٨–١٢"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:376
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Source"
msgstr "سەرچاوە"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:384
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The file path, formatter and write call are together in this handler. Ask "
"your agent to show these lines if its answer leaves them out."
msgstr ""
"ڕێڕەوی فایل، فۆرماتکەر و بانگکردنی نووسین پێکەوە لەم وەڵامدەرەدان. داوای لە "
"بریکارەکەت بکە ئەم هێڵانە پیشان بدات ئەگەر وەڵامەکەی جێیان هێشتبێت."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../guides/javascript/#follow" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:389
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0}See the full code trace and recorded REA result{ph1}."
msgstr "{ph0}شوێنپێی تەواوی کۆد و ئەنجامی تۆمارکراوی REA ببینە{ph1}."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:396
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "4. Check a prediction"
msgstr "٤. پێشبینییەک بپشکنە"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:397
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"A comma separates CSV columns. What happens when a note title itself "
"contains a comma or quotation marks?"
msgstr ""
"کۆما ستوونەکانی CSV جیا دەکاتەوە. چی ڕوودەدات کاتێک ناونیشانی تێبینییەک خۆی "
"کۆما یان نیشانەی دەقوڵەی تێدایە؟"

#. {ph0}: <span class="prompt-symbol" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph1}: </span >
#. {ph2}: <span id="first-check-prompt" >
#. {ph3}: <span translate="no">Hello, "REA"</span>
#. {ph4}: <span translate="no">toCsv</span>
#. {ph5}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#. {ph6}: </span >
#. {ph7}: <span class="terminal-cursor" aria-hidden="true">
#. {ph8}: </span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:417
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}Predict the CSV for a note with id 1 and title {ph3}. Then "
"run the example’s {ph4} formatter with {ph5} to check it. Show the "
"prediction and actual output.{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"
msgstr ""
"{ph0}›{ph1}{ph2}CSVـی تێبینییەک بە id 1 و ناونیشانی {ph3} پێشبینی بکە. پاشان"
" فۆرماتکەری {ph4}ـی نموونەکە بە {ph5} جێبەجێ بکە بۆ پشکنینی. پێشبینی و "
"دەرچوونی ڕاستەقینە پیشان بدە.{ph6}{ph7}{ph8}"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:430
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Expected formatter output"
msgstr "دەرچوونی چاوەڕوانکراوی فۆرماتکەر"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:435
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"The title stays in one quoted field; each quotation mark is doubled. This "
"checks the formatter directly with {ph0}."
msgstr ""
"ناونیشانەکە لە یەک خانەی دەقوڵەداردا دەمێنێتەوە؛ هەر نیشانەیەکی دەقوڵە دوو "
"هێندە دەبێت. ئەمە ڕاستەوخۆ فۆرماتکەرەکە بە {ph0} دەپشکنێت."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Run the check yourself"
msgstr "خۆت پشکنینەکە بکە"

#. {ph0}: <code>notes-example</code>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:442
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Open a terminal in the unpacked {ph0} folder:"
msgstr "تێرمیناڵێک لە فۆڵدەری کراوەتەوەی {ph0} بکەرەوە:"

#. {ph0}: <span translate="no">Node.js</span>
#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:448
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "{ph0} · CSV formatter"
msgstr "{ph0} · فۆرماتکەری CSV"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:464
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"This command uses a shell with here-document support, such as Bash or Zsh. "
"Your agent can run the same JavaScript in your platform’s shell."
msgstr ""
"ئەم فەرمانە شێڵێک بەکاردەهێنێت کە پشتگیری here-document دەکات، وەک Bash یان "
"Zsh. بریکارەکەت دەتوانێت هەمان JavaScript لە شێڵی پلاتفۆرمەکەتدا جێبەجێ "
"بکات."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:472
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "5. Ask another question"
msgstr "٥. پرسیارێکی دیکە بکە"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:473
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid "Try a follow-up in the same conversation:"
msgstr "پرسیارێکی دوای ئەمە لە هەمان گفتوگۆدا تاقی بکەرەوە:"

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:475
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"What happens if the file can’t be written? Follow the error back to the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"چی ڕوودەدات ئەگەر فایلەکە نەتوانرێت بنووسرێت؟ هەڵەکە شوێن پێ بکەوە بۆ "
"پەڕەکە."

#: website/public/first-investigation/index.html:480
msgctxt "page:first-investigation/index.html"
msgid ""
"Or give your agent an app of your own and ask about one button, file or "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"یان ئەپێکی خۆت بدە بە بریکارەکەت و پرسیار لەسەر یەک دوگمە، فایل یان ڕەفتار "
"بکە."

